 "summary": "The post-PR surface is minimal and self-contained: bodies stay unexposed behind `(rfl)`-proved `_def` lemmas and intro/elim pairs, each new definition carries a complete recursion with `@[simp, grind =]` on the degenerate cases, and `private` is confined to argument-local machinery that a public form subsumes. No compatibility artifacts, no duplicated declarations against Mathlib or the pre-existing `Sturm/GCD.lean`, and the general sign, gap, and squarefree facts are exported from their own modules.",
